spice
* SPICE Netlist for the Circuit
Vs 6 7 DC <Voltage_Value>
R1 4 2 <R1_Value>
R2 2 3 <R2_Value>
R3 3 7 <R3_Value>

* Annotated nodes
* Node 6: Positive terminal of Vs
* Node 7: Negative terminal of Vs and one terminal of R3
* Node 4: One terminal of R1
* Node 2: Common node between R1 and R2
* Node 3: Common node between R2 and R3